        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145609,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Spiele wie das untenstehende müssen regelmäßig dieselbe Aufgabe immer wieder ausführen.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    height: 275px;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #0B1020;&#xA;    color: #E6F0FF;&#xA;    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;   }&#xA;   button {&#xA;    background-color: #2D6BFF;&#xA;    border: none;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    text-decoration: none;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    font-size: 14px;&#xA;    padding: 6px 12px;&#xA;    margin: 0 12px 0 0;&#xA;    cursor: pointer;&#xA;   }&#xA;   #container {&#xA;    margin-top: 10px;&#xA;    min-height: 20px;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img height=180 src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/heart.png&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;heal()&quot;&gt;Use health potion&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;    let health = 50;&#xA;    function heal() {&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;container&quot;).innerHTML = &quot;Healed! Health is now &quot; + (health += 10);&#xA;     let s = document.getElementById(&quot;container&quot;).style;&#xA;     s.display = &quot;block&quot;;&#xA;     s.opacity = 1;&#xA;     (function fade() {&#xA;      if ((s.opacity -= .1) &lt; 0) s.display = &quot;none&quot;;&#xA;      else setTimeout(fade, 150);&#xA;     })();&#xA;    }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145610,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Statt viel unterschiedlichen Code zu erstellen, verwenden Spiele <strong>Funktionen</strong>, um zusammengehörigen Code zu gruppieren und die Aufgabe an einem Ort auszuführen.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    height: 275px;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #0B1020;&#xA;    color: #E6F0FF;&#xA;    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;   }&#xA;   button {&#xA;    background-color: #FF3B6B;&#xA;    border: none;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    text-decoration: none;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    font-size: 14px;&#xA;    padding: 6px 12px;&#xA;    margin: 0 12px 0 0;&#xA;    cursor: pointer;&#xA;   }&#xA;   #container {&#xA;    margin-top: 10px;&#xA;    min-height: 20px;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img height=180 src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/heart.png&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;takeDamage()&quot;&gt;Enemy hit&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;    let health = 50;&#xA;    function takeDamage() {&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;container&quot;).innerHTML = &quot;Ouch! Health is now &quot; + (health -= 10);&#xA;     let s = document.getElementById(&quot;container&quot;).style;&#xA;     s.display = &quot;block&quot;;&#xA;     s.opacity = 1;&#xA;     (function fade() {&#xA;      if ((s.opacity -= .1) &lt; 0) s.display = &quot;none&quot;;&#xA;      else setTimeout(fade, 150);&#xA;     })();&#xA;    }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145611,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um zusammengehörigen Code zu gruppieren, beginnen wir mit dem Programmieren des Schlüsselworts <code>function</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" }\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>function</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145612,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Als nächstes kommt der Name der Funktion im Camel Case, wie <code>spawnEnemy</code>, gefolgt von Klammern, <code>(</code> und <code>)</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>spawnEnemy</code>, gefolgt von <code>(</code> und schließlich <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145613,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Geschweifte Klammern <code>{</code> und <code>}</code> kennzeichnen den Codeblock, der zur Funktion gehört.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>{</code>, gefolgt von <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145614,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der Code, den wir zusammenfassen möchten, steht zwischen den geschweiften Klammern. Diese Funktion fasst zwei zusammenhängende <code>console.log()</code>-Anweisungen zusammen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"88\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Get ready to fight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>console</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>log</code>, <code>\"Get ready to fight\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145615,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um den Code auszuführen, müssen wir die Funktion <strong>aufrufen</strong>. Das machen wir, indem wir ihren Namen gefolgt von Klammern schreiben, wie <code>spawnEnemy();</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"107\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Get ready to fight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy();}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>spawnEnemy();</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145616,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie fangen wir an, zusammengehörigen Code zu gruppieren?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Durch Hinzufügen des <code>function</code>-Schlüsselworts</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Durch das Hinzufügen von Klammern</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Durch Hinzufügen des <code>function</code>-Schlüsselworts.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145617,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie benennen wir eine Funktion?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Durch die Verwendung von Camel Case</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Durch das Einfügen von Leerzeichen im Namen der Funktion</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Durch die Verwendung von Camel Case.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145618,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was machen die geschweiften Klammern <code>{</code> und <code>}</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sie markieren den Codeblock, der zur Funktion gehört</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sie geben an, welchen Code die Funktion überspringen soll</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sie markieren den Codeblock, der zur Funktion gehört.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145619,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wohin kommt der Code, den wir zusammenfassen möchten?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Zwischen den geschweiften Klammern <code>{</code> und <code>}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Zwischen den Klammern <code>(</code> und <code>)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Zwischen den geschweiften Klammern <code>{</code> und <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145620,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie führen wir den Code innerhalb einer Funktion aus?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Indem du es aufrufst</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Indem du eine Variable daraus erstellst</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Indem du es aufrufst.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145621,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code das <code>function</code>-Schlüsselwort, um die Funktion zu vervollständigen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Score update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;+10 points&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"addScore();}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>function</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145622,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib dieser Funktion einen Namen im Camel Case.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"startlevel\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"startLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level starting&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawning player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"startLevel();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>startLevel</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145623,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Markiere den Code, der zur Funktion gehört.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"resetGame\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Resetting health&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Resetting score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"resetGame();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>{</code>, gefolgt von <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 145624,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Erstelle eine abschließende <code>console.log()</code>-Anweisung innerhalb der Funktion.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"98\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"countdown\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Go!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"countdown();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>console</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>log</code>, <code>\"Go!\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 145625,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rufe die Funktion auf, indem du <code>spawn();</code> codest.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"61\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawn\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"spawn();}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>spawn();</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
